{"id":53517,"date":"2026-07-12T18:40:22","date_gmt":"2026-07-12T17:40:22","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=53517"},"modified":"2026-10-01T22:47:21","modified_gmt":"2026-10-01T21:47:21","slug":"trail-da-ladeia","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/trail-da-ladeia\/","title":{"rendered":"Trail da Ladeia 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Trail da Ladeia 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>Trail da Ladeia 2026<\/strong> (11\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o) realiza-se nos dias <strong>10 e 11 de outubro de 2026<\/strong> na freguesia de <strong>Alvorge<\/strong>, concelho de <strong>Ansi\u00e3o<\/strong>, distrito de <strong>Leiria<\/strong>. Organizado pelo <strong>Centro Social Cultural e Recreativo de Alvorge<\/strong> com o apoio do Munic\u00edpio de Ansi\u00e3o e da SolarShop, o evento percorre cerca de 98% da sua extens\u00e3o em trilhos t\u00e9cnicos, carreiros rurais e estrad\u00f5es com partida e chegada instaladas na sede do CSCR Alvorge.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">A programa\u00e7\u00e3o desportiva inicia-se no s\u00e1bado \u00e0 tarde com as provas infantis do <strong>Trail Kids<\/strong> \u00e0s 15h00. No domingo, 11 de outubro, desenrolam-se o <strong>Trail Longo 32 km<\/strong> (1300 m D+) \u00e0s 08h30, o <strong>Trail Sprint 22 km<\/strong> (670 m D+) \u00e0s 08h45, o <strong>Trail Jovem 13 km<\/strong> (450 m D+) \u00e0s 09h00 e a <strong>Caminhada 11 km<\/strong> (300 m D+). A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o inclui pequeno-almo\u00e7o, abastecimentos, t-shirt t\u00e9cnica, almo\u00e7o conv\u00edvio com porco no espeto e kidsitting.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">10 e 11 de Outubro de 2026<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-dir